==Trivia==
*The word "''Wizard''" comes from the Middle English "''wys''", meaning wise.
**In the German, Persian, and Vietnamese language settings of the game, the Ice Wizard's name translates to "Ice Magician". In the Chinese language settings of the game, the Ice Wizard's name translates to "Ice Mage".
*The Ice Wizard is 1 of 17 troops that inspired a troop in Clash of Clans, the others being [[Spear Goblins]], [[Bomber]], [[Bats]], [[Skeleton Barrel]], [[Minion Horde]], [[Firecracker]], [[Battle Ram]], [[Ice Golem]], [[Zappies]], [[Baby Dragon]], [[Giant Skeleton]], [[Ram Rider]], [[Inferno Dragon]], [[Miner]], [[Royal Ghost]], and [[Night Witch]].
**He is the first one that was added as a temporary troop.
**The word "''Legendary''" in the description in Clash of Clans could refer to the {{Rarity|Legendary}} rarity of the Ice Wizard in Clash Royale.
**Unlike his [https://clashofclans.fandom.com/wiki/Ice_Wizard Clash of Clans counterpart], the Ice Wizard in Clash Royale attacks anything in sight instead of prioritizing buildings.
*The Ice Wizard is 1 of 7 [[cards]] associated with ice, with the others being [[Ice Spirit]], [[Giant Snowball]], Ice Golem, [[Freeze]], [[Super Ice Golem]], and [[Wizard Trio]].
*The Ice Wizard was one of the first {{Rarity|Legendary}} cards to be added to the game, alongside the [[Princess]].
*The Ice Wizard is one of the first troop cards to receive a card render, alongside the [[Archers]], [[Knight]], [[Goblins]], Bomber, [[Skeletons]], [[Barbarians]], Bats, [[Royal Recruits]], Skeleton Barrel, [[Rascals]], [[Musketeer]], [[Giant]], [[Valkyrie]], [[Wizard]], [[Flying Machine]], [[Hog Rider]], [[Royal Hogs]], [[Dart Goblin]], [[Zappies]], [[Elixir Golem]], Baby Dragon, [[Skeleton Army]], [[Witch]], [[P.E.K.K.A.|P.E.K.K.A]], [[Prince]], [[Balloon]], Giant Skeleton, [[Goblin Giant]], [[Hunter]], [[Electro Dragon]], [[Wall Breakers]], [[Bowler]], [[Cannon Cart]], [[Mega Knight]], Ram Rider, Miner, Royal Ghost, [[Magic Archer]], [[Bandit]], [[Lava Hound]], Night Witch, and [[Fisherman]].
*His description implies that TVs might exist within Clash Royale.
*His description incorrectly states his type of mustache as handlebar; based on his appearance both on the card image and in-game, it appears to be a horseshoe mustache.
*Occasionally when attacking and during his deployment time, the Ice Wizard exclaims "''Lunta!''", "''Kylmä!''", "''Pakastaa!''", "''Jäädy!''", "''Jää!''", "''Jäätykää!''" or "''Täältä pesee!''". He actually speaks Finnish, and nearly all his words refer to icy things, for example, "''Snow!''", "''Cold!''", "''Freeze!''", "''Turn to ice!''", "''Ice!''", "''You turn to ice!''" or "''Here it comes!''"
**The Ice Wizard is 1 of 24 troops that speak distinct words when on the field, the others being [[Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Mega Minion]], Wizard, Hog Rider, P.E.K.K.A., [[Dark Prince]], Bowler, Ram Rider, [[Electro Wizard]], Princess, Magic Archer, [[Lumberjack]], [[Mother Witch]], Fisherman, [[Goblin Machine]], [[Super Mini P.E.K.K.A.]], [[Santa Hog Rider]], [[Super Magic Archer]], [[Golden Knight]], [[Boss Bandit]], [[Archer Queen]], [[Little Prince]], and the [[Terry]].
*When the Ice Wizard is deployed, a small pile of snow is left behind him before he starts to move. Likewise, when he walks, a snow crunching sound effect is played.
*The Wizard and Ice Wizard are revealed to be cousins according to the balance changes in the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]].
*The [[Wizard/Evolution|Evolved Wizard]], Ice Wizard, and Electro Wizard are responsible for creating the [[Void]], according to the Clash Royale [https://youtube.com/shorts/32qX1fEbxX4?si=KqXAuxOvVZ5QaMFP Void intro video].
*When the Ice Wizard slows an enemy, a pile of snow will fall off the target, and the enemy also leaves a trail of snow when it walks.
**The enemy will also speak with a deeper pitch. [[Rage]] however will do the opposite.
**The Ice Wizard's hands appear to be glowing, even when not attacking, unlike the Wizard and Electro Wizard.
*The Ice Wizard, along with the Archers, Goblins, Barbarians, Wizard, Hog Rider, [[Battle Healer]], Witch, Miner, and the Archer Queen, are featured as a [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Characters character] in [https://squad-busters.fandom.com/wiki/Squad_Busters_Wiki Squad Busters].
*The Ice Wizard is the subject of certain cosmetics in the game. More specifically:
**The Ice Wizard is the subject of 4 [[Emotes]].
**The Ice Wizard is the subject of a few [[Battle Banners|Battle Banner]] items.
***The Cold Corkscrew decoration is a reference to [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iceman_(Marvel_Comics) Iceman]. Its description says "''I think I've seen this trick in a comic book before.''", which is also a reference to the same character.
*A [[Clone|cloned]] Ice Wizard does not fall from the sky when deployed.
*The Ice Wizard was featured in the winning [[Battle Decks|decks]] of multiple Clash Royale Tournaments. More specifically:
**The Ice Wizard was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/C5qBcdcErfM?si=e37mhAgNKAA5kMJI Clash Royale League 2018 Tournament], by a player called Lciop.
**The Ice Wizard was featured in the winning deck of the [https://www.youtube.com/live/cmBlEI-aDoo?si=UoD1Sit2YvQR19xs Clash Royale League 2019 Tournament], by a player called Surgical Goblin.
*The Ice Wizard was featured in a promotional image for Merge Tactics, but has never been added into the game mode.

